{
  "source": {
    "design": "Outage Light (ADR 0053): a white map app in the manner of Google Maps. White surfaces, grey text in three steps, hairline greys, one blue (#1b6ef3, the icon's blue), and the system font (Roboto on Android). Rounded cards, pill chips.",
    "states": "The four power states on white: green on, amber maybe, red out, teal back (so 'back' never reads as the blue of the app). The map colours are the fills of the translucent hex layer, drawn at about 40% over the street map."
